<title>UK: SOCCER-SCOTLAND V AUSTRIA TEAMS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SCOTLAND V AUSTRIA TEAMS.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teams for Wednesday's World Cup European group four qualifier between Scotland and Austria at Celtic Park:</p>
<p>Scotland: 1-Jim Leighton; 2-Craig Burley, 4-Colin Calderwood, 5-Colin Hendry, 3-Tom Boyd, 6-Tosh McKinlay, 7-Kevin Gallacher, 10-Gary McAllister, 8-Paul Lambert, 9-Darren Jackson, 11-John Collins.</p>
<p>Austria: 1-Michael Konsel; 5-Wolfgang Feiersinger, 7-Franz Aigner, 4-Anton Pfeffer, 3-Peter Schottel, 2-Markus Schopp, 6-Andreas Heraf, 10-Andreas Herzog, 8-Arnold Wetl, 11-Peter Stoger, 9-Anton Polster</p>
<p>Referee: Nikolai Levnikov (Russia)</p>
</text>
